key=
description=Say how many {what}

[command Say Yield Marked]
; 15 November 2026 (A11): the yield of what is marked, in DbDo and FileDir alike. ON ALT+SHIFT+Y since 21 November
; 2026: the Y family is Alt for all in view, Alt+Shift for the marked, as DbDo's W and L families read.
apps=DbDo, FileDir
key=Alt+Shift+Y
description=Say how many {what}

